WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.280
There’s something profound&nbsp;
about the innocence of a child.&nbsp;

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:08.720
And to the untrained eye, SCP-053 seems like&nbsp;
an adorable little three-year-old girl - the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.120
epitome of innocence. However, just being&nbsp;
too close to her can be incredibly dangerous,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.960
as being in her presence for longer&nbsp;
than ten minutes will provoke paranoia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.840
and homicidal urges in&nbsp;
anyone over the age of three.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.920
Eventually, those affected will begin to act&nbsp;
on these urges, killing everyone around them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.920
and then attacking the little girl. However,&nbsp;
attempts to physically harm her will cause&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.520
the attacker to die immediately. SCP-053 will&nbsp;
regenerate instantaneously from any physical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:38.720
damage done to her regardless of severity, and&nbsp;
will appear wholly ignorant to the experience.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.080
Surprisingly, when introduced to SCP-682, she had&nbsp;
the complete opposite effect on her new playmate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.160
Her being around 682 made&nbsp;
the beast shockingly docile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.520
causing it to calm down and allowing&nbsp;
her to play with it. But of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.760
it immediately started killing people&nbsp;
again as soon as she left. How rude.

